		(descr "TI LP5912-3.3DRVR WSON-6 (DRV). Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/LP5912.pdf p35-37 DRV0006A (4222173/C): body 2.0 x 2.0, EP 1.0 x 1.6; land example 6X (0.45) x 6X (0.3), 4X (0.65), (1.95) row centres, EP (1) x (1.6), (R0.05); stencil: EP 2 windows (1.0 x 0.7) at (0.45), 88 % printed coverage; pin 1 top-left. TI land with the toe trimmed (heel edge 0.75 kept); EP and paste as TI. DENSE: budget envelope WSON22 2.2 x 2.2 vs TI example 2.4: outer edge 1.20 -> 1.10 (0.10 past the body), pads 0.35 x 0.30 at +-0.925 still cover the 0.25-0.35 terminals. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:WSON-6-1EP_2x2mm_P0.65mm_EP1x1.6mm (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/WSON-6-1EP_2x2mm_P0.65mm_EP1x1.6mm_Dense.json | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 1.08 (DRV0006A body 1.9-2.1 -> 1.05 max + 0.03), heel 0.75 kept, width 0.30 kept (power part), EP 1.0x1.6/paste unchanged")
